{"articleNo":"862","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=862&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009년 대학 교육역량강화사업","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.07.01","hit":"22601","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>2009년 대학 교육역량강화사업</strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">□ 교육역량강화사업이란 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"122\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"635\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -21.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 21.3pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;○</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 대학의 교육역량 및 성과를 측정ㆍ평가할 수 있는 지표를 중심으로 사전에 구성된</span></p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -21.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 21.3pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;공식(Formula)를 적용하여 교육역량 및 성과가 우수한 대학을 선정하고, 해당대학의</span></p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -21.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 21.3pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;성과와 재학생 규모 등을 고려, 교육비용을 지원받는 사업입니다.</span></p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -26.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 26.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;○</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">대학은 지원받은 재원을 스스로의 발전전략에 따라 교육역량강화사업을 추진</span></p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -26.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 26.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 합니다.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"> </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -26.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 26.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">□ 사업목표 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"78\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"635\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">○</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 대학의 교육역량 제고 </span></p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 고등 교육과정 내실화 및 교육 인프라 확충</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p styl